## Complete Example: Database-Driven Menu

```cshtml
@using Syncfusion.Blazor.Navigations

<div id="target">Right click to open</div>

<SfContextMenu Target="#target" Items="@contextActions">
    <MenuFieldSettings 
        Text="ActionName" 
        IconCss="IconClass"
        Disabled="IsDisabled">
    </MenuFieldSettings>
